DialogueLibrary: {
	Dryad: {
		CrossingOver_Greeting: {
			Line1.Text: Then let's not keep Ingress waiting.[] The way through will stay open for as long as you need it,[] and there's one just like it on the other side to bring you home.
			Line2.Text: Find your way through Ingress,[] past whatever guards it,[] and into the Library of Reverie.
			Line3.Text: Now,[] look to where you first came into this world.
		}

		Greeting: {
			Line1.Text: Forgive the entrance![] Crossing over is never gentle...
			Line2.Text: You are the one [speakerName:Guide] told me about,[] [speakerName:player], [yes?]

			Line3: {
				Text: I felt the seal of Apathos break the moment it was loosened.[] Even from Ingress, you can feel it's darkness echoing.
				Choice1.Text: What's Apathos?
				Choice2.Text: What's Ingress?
			}
		}

		ReturnToTown.Line1.Text: Where did you wander off to?[] She'll be arriving any moment now,[] and I'd rather you were in town to meet her.

		CrossingOver_Apathos: {
			Line1.Text: Where do I begin?
			Line2.Text: Apathos is a form of Magick,[] which is a sorcery of it's own...
			Line3.Text: It was manifested back in the Primordial Age,[] when beings started [playing] with an [ancient dark spirit][...]
			Line4.Text: It's known as Iniki,[] It's archaic name is [Trelamium].

			Line5: {
				Text: I try best [not] to speak those words.[] In any case,[] you'll need to develop proper Qualia in Ingress before facing off against it.
				Choice1.Text: I understand.
				Choice2.Text: What's Ingress?
			}
		}

		CrossingOver_Ingress: {
			Line1.Text: Ingress, yes![] It's a domain within Sylvanwalde, the world in which I come from.
			Line2.Text: In my land,[] there are other Druids, Ents, Elves, and more.
			Line3.Text: It is quite the beautiful place,[] If I may indulge.
			Line4.Text: Hehe,[] you definitely are indulging...
			Line5.Text: In any case,[] Ingress is where all souls must go to harness their inner Qualia.

			Line6: {
				Text: That which is something you, [speakerName:player],[] the Hero needs to harness in order to stop Apathos.
				Choice1.Text: I understand.
				Choice2.Text: What's Apathos?
			}
		}

		CrossingOver_Lecture: {
			Line1.Text: "[speakerName:player],[] this isn't something can't be fought with a staff and sword[], at least not the way you might suspect."
			Line2.Text: But it can be mitigated,[] that is the Art I can teach you.
			Line3.Text: Give me a time to settle in my quarters.[] Approach me thereafter,[] and we will begin.
		}

		CrossingOver_Apathos_Initial: {
			Line1.Text: Where do I begin?
			Line2.Text: Apathos is a form of Magick,[] which is a sorcery of it's own...
			Line3.Text: It was manifested back in the Primordial Age,[] when beings started [playing] with an [ancient dark spirit][...]
			Line4.Text: It's known as Iniki,[] It's archaic name is [Trelamium].

			Line5: {
				Text: I try best [not] to speak those words.[] In any case,[] you'll need to develop proper Qualia in Ingress before facing off against it.
				Choice1.Text: What's Ingress?
			}
		}

		CrossingOver_Ingress_Initial: {
			Line1.Text: Ingress, yes![] It's a domain within Sylvanwalde, the world in which I come from.
			Line2.Text: In my land,[] there are other Druids, Ents, Elves, and more.
			Line3.Text: It is quite the beautiful place,[] If I may indulge.
			Line4.Text: Hehe,[] you definitely are indulging...
			Line5.Text: In any case,[] Ingress is where all souls must go to harness their inner Qualia.

			Line6: {
				Text: That which is something you, [speakerName:player],[] the Hero needs to harness in order to stop Apathos.
				Choice1.Text: What's Apathos?
			}
		}
	}
}
